tion.\n\nCHARACTERISTICS\n• Real-time atmospheric pressure measurement\n• Device pressure support (device sensor)\n• Reference needle (track previous pressure reading)\n• Ability to select the Barometer of the weather station or device\n• Supported units of measurement in mBar, inHg, mmHg, hPa, kPa, torr\n• Forecast graph for each location (accessible via In-App purchase)\n• 3-day daily forecast (accessible via In-App purchase)\n• Dynamic indication of the forecast in the current time (accessible via In-App purchase)\n• Maximum and minimum daily pressure indication (accessible via In-App purchase)\n• Location detection\n• Weather conditions detection\n• Search location\n• Save favorite places (unlimited)\n• iCloud support\n• Reliability in its use\n• Intuitive graphics\n• Easy to use\n\nUNIT OF MEASURE\nYou can easily choose to see the atmospheric pressure measured in:\n• Millibar (mBar)\n• Inches of mercury (inHg)\n• Millimeters of mercury (mmHg)\n• Hectopascals (hPa)\n• Kilopascals (kPa)\n• Torr (torr)\n\nSUPPORT\nIf you like the application, don't forget to leave us a review on the App Store.\nFor suggestions contact us at info@lionsapp.com, or visit www.lionsapp.com", "sellerUrl": "http://www.lionsapp.com/iphone/barometer", "languageCodesISO2A": ["DA", "NL", "EN", "FI", "FR", "DE", "IT", "JA", "NB", "PT", "RU", "ZH", "ES", "SV"], "fileSizeBytes": "9023488", "formattedPrice": "￦4,400", "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "artistId": 432915499, "artistName": "LionsApp di Nallbati Elton", "userRatingCount": 0}]}